{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Finalize plugins after the last fatal check.** This check runs after manager closure releases plugin instances and after `onInvocationEnd` reported `PENDING` or `SUCCEEDED`. A scope fatal observed during shutdown therefore makes the caller fail/retry while OTel and Insight retain a stale outcome. Keep plugins available through the final fatal observation and dispatch one `RETRYING` snapshot before release, or preserve the already-finalized caller outcome.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75xmUv","finding_digest":"8be69537d7226d4ace1dfef289a46b28f9e5175206d90fffc1bd85e48ff10825","finding_id":"arf_v1_rptjkn6xejwuvtq573zitjdlfd","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-finalization-bypass","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-finalization-bypass","line":286,"observation_digest":"0c5109cf637c0feb3f748f5546c198d7c986a35516b18617a063409fc0a02b06","observation_id":"aro_v1_briqtt3dpqh6wp3ur5kunqmy27","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rptjkn6xejwuvtq573zitjdlfd","published_at":"2026-10-06T01:07:59Z","review_id":"arr_v1_buxa4o7ugg7rmklkn6vcnqh7ie","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"1ebdc9ba92eafd4373735e9cf369acf681fac4ab","reviewer":"codex","start_line":286,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_4rmjayubj4brrnmjzkbnce34y3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T01:07:59Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
